  "_tuning_note": "2026-10-17 scout intelligence run (playbook: hermes/politics/skills/politics-scout/playbook.md). The one rule: clip the moment, never people talking about it. Every Politics post that did well was raw footage (Fiato 10,737, CFPB/Toyota 7,680, Dimon/Warren 4,910, C-SPAN 'I'd reconsider' 1,766 in a day). So: `rank` lifts C-SPAN and official feeds, exchanges and quotes, turns commentary, reuploads and 'X vs Y:' farm titles down, and fits length to a 65-90 s cut; `format_words` (gaggle, town hall...) say what kind of video it is and are no longer heat; block_channels never reach the board; half-life 18 h; YouTube channel feeds rank as videos (Shorts and views, no yt-dlp call); dated searches follow the calendar (debates until Nov 3, speeches Nov 3-6, hearings from Nov 9)."
 }
